                                <td class="px-4 py-3 text-rose-500"><span class="inline-flex gap-0.5"><svg class="w-[1.1em] h-[1.1em] inline-block fill-current -mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polygon></svg><svg class="w-[1.1em] h-[1.1em] inline-block fill-current -mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polygon></svg><svg class="w-[1.1em] h-[1.1em] inline-block fill-current -mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polygon></svg><svg class="w-[1.1em] h-[1.1em] inline-block fill-current -mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polygon></svg><svg class="w-[1.1em] h-[1.1em] inline-block fill-current -mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polygon></svg></span><span class="text-xs text-rose-600 block mt-0.5 font-bold">Không thể thiếu</span></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3">Gió lạnh ở Kailash khiến cơ thể mất nhiệt rất nhanh. Một chiếc áo chắn gió tốt thường quan trọng hơn một chiếc áo quá dày.</td>
                            </tr>
